                         SOLAR V1.2.1

Do you remember the days before you bought your Psion when you
used a pocket diary that had weekly sunrise/sunset times for
London (that is if you bought an English diary)?

The attached application calculates sunrise/sunset times for a
city defined in your world file and writes the answer into an
agenda file.  It works on Psion 3a, I don't believe that it will
work on a Psion 3 due to a system call.  It does not take
daylight saving into account.

This post contains version 1.2.1.  It contains various new
features including Civil/Nautical/Astronomical Twilight, Daylight
Saving handling.

The source code is included, please feel free to make use of it.
All that I ask is that if you do enhance or correct the program
is that you tell me about it and send me a copy of the code.

A number of people have written asking for a version of this
program that calculates moon phase and rise/set times.  I do not
have a calculation for this.  SOLAR is based on a sun rise/set
calculation that I found already in OPL.  If you have a lunar
calculation please let me have it and I will be happy to oblige.

